{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The DEMO version includes the complete map of <i>Three Kingdoms Conquest</i>, along with basic level editor features that support map export and import!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own world\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game with a built-in editor. Manage diverse resources, recruit workers, develop industries, govern domestic affairs, and summon legendary characters to turn the tide of fate! The game offers three official worlds to explore, plus full support for creating and sharing your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/8c1363e2866a5236630d291d68d1faa1.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance every resource\u2014input, output, chain and yield\u2014to unlock new tech and grow your realm. One shortfall can topple the rest: think like a statesman, not a hoarder. Recruit enigmatic heroes to tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop the resizable window anywhere on your screen and let your empire tick while you work, stream, or nap.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/9c3a7362139c614d0af55da4e31486d6.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis Mode, you can create a World of your own. You can introduce new functional modules, add every kind of resource, set each interaction\u2019s detailed behavior and the logic behind it, create characters together with their images and back-stories, and weave in any plot you want\u2014all edited with ease on a visual relationship graph that lets you control absolutely everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/7f7cf0db5b381645470c5e455a3f53d2.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export your self-made world to share with others, and you can also import maps created by fellow players to enjoy! In the official release, full Steam Workshop support will be enabled\u2014letting you exchange and interact with creators around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator built for idle play: we only craft the underlying logic\u2014everything about the world\u2019s style, its story, and how the game unfolds is entirely up to you.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984430?t=1759586011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984430?t=1759586011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/9535fba0ceecbdecf69c8c5d44aeef0a62b7b681/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759586011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/9535fba0ceecbdecf69c8c5d44aeef0a62b7b681/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759586011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some in-game images may contain content such as \"revealing clothing\" or \"sexual innuendo,\" which may not be suitable for all age groups."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The DEMO version includes the complete map of <i>Three Kingdoms Conquest</i>, along with basic level editor features that support map export and import!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own world\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game with a built-in editor. Manage diverse resources, recruit workers, develop industries, govern domestic affairs, and summon legendary characters to turn the tide of fate! The game offers three official worlds to explore, plus full support for creating and sharing your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/8c1363e2866a5236630d291d68d1faa1.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance every resource\u2014input, output, chain and yield\u2014to unlock new tech and grow your realm. One shortfall can topple the rest: think like a statesman, not a hoarder. Recruit enigmatic heroes to tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop the resizable window anywhere on your screen and let your empire tick while you work, stream, or nap.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/9c3a7362139c614d0af55da4e31486d6.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis Mode, you can create a World of your own. You can introduce new functional modules, add every kind of resource, set each interaction\u2019s detailed behavior and the logic behind it, create characters together with their images and back-stories, and weave in any plot you want\u2014all edited with ease on a visual relationship graph that lets you control absolutely everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/7f7cf0db5b381645470c5e455a3f53d2.avif?t=1759586011\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export your self-made world to share with others, and you can also import maps created by fellow players to enjoy! In the official release, full Steam Workshop support will be enabled\u2014letting you exchange and interact with creators around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.poster.avif?t=1759586011\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.webm?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.mp4?t=1759586011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator built for idle play: we only craft the underlying logic\u2014everything about the world\u2019s style, its story, and how the game unfolds is entirely up to you.</strong></h2>","developers":["BambooCopter"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3972520","name":"Genesis Relic: Idle Sandbox Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984430/244192769e1e77b0b699f60b7c7f2d5750bbd4e9/header.jpg?t=1759586011","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984430/1911854143/cf6467b2f80ea0484f2e12400d4215b898455961/1759052409/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759052735","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984430/1911854143/cf6467b2f80ea0484f2e12400d4215b898455961/1759052409/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759052735","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984430/1911854143/cf6467b2f80ea0484f2e12400d4215b898455961/1759052409/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759052735","id":257188269,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188269/movie480.mp4?t=1759052735","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/